# @Span is a structural type alias defined in builtin_core.llt.
# This test verifies that @Span resolves as a valid annotation in the full pipeline
# (not just the bootstrap type-stage scope) without producing an "undefined type" error.
# Span is an open dict with required fields: file, start-line, start-col, end-line, end-col.
[@Span [file: "foo.llt"  start-line: 1  start-col: 1  end-line: 1  end-col: 5]]
=== out
["file": "foo.llt"  "start-line": 1  "start-col": 1  "end-line": 1  "end-col": 5]
